      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving understandability.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — removing unused imports/constants, and adding clearer comments and assertion messages.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes unused imports (`ParameterizedTest`, `MethodSource`, `assertNotNull`, `assertFalse`) and the unused `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED` constant, adds a Javadoc comment with an ASCII stream-layout diagram, and replaces terse assertion messages (\"Skip 1\", \"Read 2\") with full-sentence descriptions that explain both the operation and the expected outcome."
    }
